# Inbox

Dumb-capture zone. Dump anything here mid-session — a stray idea, a task, a
fact worth remembering — without stopping to file it properly. Boot triage
(see `CLAUDE.md`) routes each item to `ideas.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `memory/`,
or discards it as noise, then archives the line to `inbox-archive.md`.

Say "inbox this" and paste anything; it lands under `## Unprocessed`
untouched until the next triage pass.

